/T (SKVT Government Degree College \(Sree Kandukuri Veeresalingam Theistic College\), established in 1972 in Rajahmundry, is affiliated to Adikavi Nannaya University. The college offers 17 undergraduate programmes in Arts, Science, and Commerce streams, with select courses available in English medium. Originally managed by the Hithakarini Samaj founded by Sree Kandukuri Veeresalingam Pantulu in 1906, it was taken over by the Government of Andhra Pradesh in          2022 and continues to uphold its rich legacy through quality education and holistic student development.)
